WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.267
Connect the JSX cursor in Neovim to your live page.

00:02.267 --> 00:07.267
Move to the heading in Neovim. Its live DOM element is highlighted.

00:07.267 --> 00:12.267
Move the JSX cursor again. The browser highlight follows.

00:12.267 --> 00:17.600
Source-map matching also connects JSX images to the live page.

00:17.600 --> 00:20.533
Move outside JSX to clear the highlight. Your page stays interactive.
